@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@apiVersion = {{apiVersion}}

### Health Check
# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/healthz

### API Info
# @name apiInfo
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.name == feedpushr

### Metrics (expvar)
# @name metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/vars

?? status == 200

### OpenAPI Specification
# @name openapiSpec
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/openapi.json

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.openapi == 3.0.3
